  "_comment": "Per-starter XP learnset, paced for the FULL 8-gym + Elite 4 arc (not just the 1-gym PoC). starter_deck = the 3-card Normal-filler deck you begin with. Each entry in `lines` is one move 'line' whose stages unlock at cumulative XP: the first stage is ADDED to the deck, later stages REPLACE the previous card in that line (Vine Whip -> Razor Leaf -> Leaf Storm). A stage with xp 0 is granted at run start.",

  "_economy": "Assumed XP economy (see constants.json xp): each gym segment yields ~90 XP from mandatory fights (gym leader = 90; between-gym trainer mid-bosses = 30) and up to ~30 more from optional wilds (~3 x 10). So mandatory:optional ~= 3:1, i.e. min ~90/gym, grind ~120/gym. Unlock ladder (cumulative XP): [40, 110, 190, 280, 370, 460, 550, 640, 700]. That completes a starter's full move set by ~gym 8 on the minimum path and ~gym 6 if every optional wild is cleared. Values are PROVISIONAL and to be balance-tuned once the 8-gym run_config exists (Phase 5).",

